        }

        .hero-actions {
            display: flex;
            gap: 14px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            margin-top: 28px;
        }

        .btn {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            min-height: 50px;
            padding: 0 24px;
            border-radius: 999px;
            font-size: 15px;
            font-weight: 700;
            transition: transform 0.2s ease;
        }

        .btn:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); }

        .btn-primary {
            color: #fff8ef;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #b24636 0%, #8b251a 100%);
            box-shadow: 0 14px 28px rgba(166, 58, 44, 0.24);
        }

        .btn-secondary {
            color: var(--ink);
            background: rgba(255, 253, 248, 0.9);
            border: 1px solid rgba(36, 25, 21, 0.12);
        }

        .hero-meta {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
            gap: 14px;
            margin-top: 32px;
        }

        .meta-item {
            padding: 16px 18px;
            background: rgba(239, 225, 207, 0.45);
            border-radius: 18px;
        }

        .meta-item strong {
            display: block;
            font-size: 22px;
            color: var(--cinnabar);
        }

        .meta-item span {
            font-size: 13px;
            color: rgba(36, 25, 21, 0.72);
        }

        .hero-panel {
            border-radius: 28px;
            padding: 28px;
            background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(49, 82, 71, 0.98), rgba(33, 58, 49, 0.98));
            color: #fdf8ef;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: space-between;
        }

        .panel-badge {
            display: inline-block;
            align-self: flex-start;
            padding: 7px 14px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 248, 235, 0.22);
            border-radius: 999px;
            font-size: 12px;
            letter-spacing: 0.12em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .hero-panel h2 {
            font-size: 30px;
            line-height: 1.18;
            margin-bottom: 14px;
        }

        .hero-panel p,
        .hero-panel li {
            color: rgba(253, 248, 239, 0.82);
        }

        .panel-list {
            list-style: none;
            display: grid;
            gap: 14px;
            margin: 24px 0;
        }

        .panel-list li {
            padding: 12px 14px;
            border-radius: 18px;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
        }

        section { padding: 30px 0 70px; }

        .section-head {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: end;
            gap: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 26px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .section-head h2 {
            font-size: clamp(30px, 4vw, 44px);
            line-height: 1.16;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }

        .section-head p {
            max-width: 680px;
        }

        .story-card {
            border-radius: 28px;
            padding: 34px;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.1fr) minmax(280px, 0.9fr);
            gap: 26px;
        }

        .story-card ul,
        .carrier-card ul,
        .plan-card ul {
            list-style: none;
            display: grid;
            gap: 9px;
            margin-top: 18px;
            color: rgba(36, 25, 21, 0.74);
        }

        .story-card li,
        .carrier-card li,
        .plan-card li {
            padding-left: 14px;
            position: relative;
        }

        .story-card li::before,
        .carrier-card li::before,
        .plan-card li::before {
            content: "";
            width: 5px;
            height: 5px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: var(--cinnabar);
            position: absolute;
            left: 0;
            top: 12px;
        }

        .carrier-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
            gap: 20px;
        }

        .carrier-card,
        .plan-card,
        .step,
        .faq-item {
            border-radius: 24px;
            padding: 26px;
        }

        .carrier-card h3,
        .plan-card h3,
        .step h3,
        .faq-item h3 {
            font-size: 24px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .plan-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
            gap: 20px;
        }

        .plan-tag {
            display: inline-flex;
            width: fit-content;
            min-height: 28px;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 0 11px;
            border-radius: 999px;
            background: rgba(183, 138, 66, 0.13);
            color: var(--gold);
            font-size: 12px;
            margin-bottom: 14px;
        }

        .steps-grid,
        .faq-grid {
            display: grid;
            gap: 20px;
        }

        .steps-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
        .faq-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); }

        .step-no {
            width: 42px;
            height: 42px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
            color: #fff8ef;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--gold), var(--cinnabar));
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        .closing-card {
            border-radius: 30px;
            padding: 40px;
            text-align: center;
            background:
                linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(36, 25, 21, 0.92), rgba(71, 42, 28, 0.92)),
                #261a16;
            color: #fff8ef;
        }

        .closing-card h2 {
            font-size: clamp(30px, 4.4vw, 46px);
            margin-bottom: 14px;
        }

        .closing-card p {
            max-width: 720px;
            margin: 0 auto 24px;
            color: rgba(255, 248, 239, 0.82);
        }

        footer { padding: 0 0 42px; }

        .footer-card {
            border-top: 1px solid rgba(36, 25, 21, 0.08);
            padding-top: 28px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            gap: 20px;
            color: rgba(36, 25, 21, 0.6);
            font-size: 13px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        @media (max-width: 980px) {
            .hero-grid,
            .story-card,
            .carrier-grid,
            .plan-grid,
            .steps-grid,
            .faq-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 720px) {
            .topbar-inner,
            .section-head,
            .footer-card {
                flex-direction: column;
                align-items: flex-start;
            }

            .nav { gap: 12px; }
            .hero { padding-top: 36px; }
            .hero-copy,
            .hero-panel,
            .story-card,
            .closing-card { padding: 26px; }
            .hero-meta { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
            .btn { width: 100%; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <header class="topbar">
        <div class="container topbar-inner">
            <a class="brand" href="index.html">
                <span class="brand-mark">Oriental Destiny</span>
                <span class="brand-name">Feng Shui Jewelry Matching</span>
            </a>
            <nav class="nav">
                <a href="instant_reading.html">Free Preview</a>
                <a href="#plans">Plans</a>
                <a href="#carriers">Bracelet / Pendant</a>
                <a href="products.html">How It Works</a>
                <a href="checkout.html">Order</a>
            </nav>
        </div>
    </header>

    <main>
        <section class="hero">
            <div class="container hero-grid">
                <div class="hero-copy">
                    <div class="eyebrow">Physical Feng Shui jewelry + personalized matching</div>
                    <h1>Your birth chart says your luck needs a channel. We build the jewelry around it.</h1>
                    <p>Most jewelry is chosen by look. Ours is chosen by your chart — then confirmed with you before it ships. One order, one bracelet or pendant, matched to your specific Five Elements and life focus.</p>
                    <div class="hero-actions">
                        <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="instant_reading.html">Try a Free Preview</a>
                        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="checkout.html">Start My Matching</a>
                        <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="products.html">View Plans</a>
                    </div>
                    <div class="hero-meta">
                        <div class="meta-item">
                            <strong>$99</strong>
                            <span>One order: personalized reading + physical jewelry, confirmed before shipping</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="meta-item">
                            <strong>6 Plans</strong>
                            <span>Career, wealth, love, protection, zodiac, and elemental balance</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="meta-item">
                            <strong>2 Carriers</strong>
                            <span>Bracelet or pendant — your choice, confirmed after reading</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <aside class="hero-panel">
                    <div>
                        <span class="panel-badge">How this is different from a jewelry shop</span>
                        <h2>You don't pick a product. You pick a life area — and we match the jewelry to your chart.</h2>
                        <p>The jewelry exists to make the reading tangible. But what makes it worth $99 is the recommendation that comes from your birth chart — not the material cost of the item itself.</p>
                        <ul class="panel-list">
                            <li>Choose a life focus: career, wealth, love, protection, or elements</li>
                            <li>Choose bracelet or pendant</li>
                            <li>Submit your birth date, time, and location</li>
                            <li>We send you the recommended item for confirmation before shipping</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                    <div class="hero-actions">
                        <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="instant_reading.html">See an Instant Reading</a>
                        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="checkout.html">Order a Personalized Plan</a>
                    </div>
                </aside>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section>
            <div class="container story-card">
                        <div>
                            <div class="section-head">
                                <div>
                                    <h2>See a free preview first</h2>
                                    <p>No commitment needed. Enter your birth details and get a mini Five Elements reading instantly — shows you how the matching works before you order the full service.</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <ul>
                                <li>Instant symbolic result on the spot — no form to fill out beyond birth details</li>
                                <li>Shows your Day Master, dominant elements, and your current energetic state</li>
                                <li>Used by cold traffic who want to feel something before spending $99</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <h3 style="font-size: 26px; margin-bottom: 12px;">Worth doing before ordering</h3>
                            <p style="color: rgba(36, 25, 21, 0.76); margin-bottom: 18px;">The preview gives you a real taste of the reading experience — a mini version of what the full $99 service delivers. Most customers who use it convert to the paid order.</p>
                            <a class="btn btn-primary" href="instant_reading.html">Try the Free Preview</a>
                        </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section>
            <div class="container story-card">
                        <div>
                            <div class="section-head">
                                <div>
                                    <h2>What you actually receive</h2>
                                    <p>Every order is one focused service: a birth chart reading that recommends the exact jewelry for your situation, then shipping the confirmed item to you.</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <ul>
                                <li>A personalized Five Elements and zodiac reading for your chosen life focus</li>
                                <li>The recommended material, color, and symbolic direction for your bracelet or pendant</li>
                                <li>Final item confirmed with you before it ships — no surprises</li>
                                <li>Tracking number and follow-up included</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <h3 style="font-size: 26px; margin-bottom: 12px;">Why it costs $99</h3>
                            <p style="color: rgba(36, 25, 21, 0.76); margin-bottom: 18px;">The jewelry itself costs $3–15 in materials. The $99 covers the personalized reading, the time to match your chart, and the confirmation process. Most customers understand this when they see the preview first.</p>
                        </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section id="carriers">
            <div class="container">
                <div class="section-head">
                    <div>
                        <h2>Bracelet or pendant — which one fits your focus?</h2>
                        <p>Both carry the same energetic weight. The right choice depends on your life area and what kind of support you want to wear closest.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="carrier-grid">
                    <article class="carrier-card">
                        <h3>Bracelet</h3>
                        <p>Worn daily. Works continuously on your energy field.</p>
                        <ul>
                            <li>Best for: career, wealth, love, and elemental balance</li>
                            <li>Matched with crystal, jade, wood, cinnabar, or metal</li>
                            <li>Material confirmed after your birth chart reading</li>
                        </ul>
                    </article>

                    <article class="carrier-card">
                        <h3>Pendant</h3>
                        <p>Close to your heart. Strong symbolic presence.</p>
                        <ul>
                            <li>Best for: protection, zodiac guardian, and emotional stability</li>
                            <li>Matched with jade, obsidian, silver, or guardian symbols</li>
                            <li>Symbol and cord style confirmed after your reading</li>
                        </ul>
                    </article>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section id="plans">
            <div class="container">
                <div class="section-head">
                    <div>
                        <h2>Choose your focus</h2>
                        <p>All plans can be fulfilled as either a bracelet or pendant. The customer chooses the direction; the reading decides the exact material. All six plans use the same $99 price.</p>
                    </div>
                    <a class="btn btn-primary" href="checkout.html">Choose My Plan</a>
                </div>

                <div class="plan-grid">
                    <article class="plan-card">
                        <span class="plan-tag">Five Elements</span>
                        <h3>Elemental Balance</h3>
                        <p>For Wood, Fire, Earth, Metal, or Water support based on your chart.</p>
                    </article>
                    <article class="plan-card">
                        <span class="plan-tag">Zodiac</span>
                        <h3>Zodiac Guardian</h3>
                        <p>For Chinese zodiac, guardian Buddha, and symbolic protection matching.</p>
                    </article>
                    <article class="plan-card">
                        <span class="plan-tag">Career</span>
                        <h3>Career & Allies</h3>
                        <p>For promotion, business growth, exams, authority, and helpful people.</p>
                    </article>
                    <article class="plan-card">
                        <span class="plan-tag">Wealth</span>
                        <h3>Wealth & Retention</h3>
                        <p>For income stability, business flow, windfalls, and reducing leakage.</p>
                    </article>
                    <article class="plan-card">
                        <span class="plan-tag">Love</span>
                        <h3>Love & Harmony</h3>
                        <p>For romance, social charm, emotional repair, and relationship harmony.</p>
                    </article>
                    <article class="plan-card">
                        <span class="plan-tag">Protection</span>
                        <h3>Safety & Protection</h3>
                        <p>For peace, grounding, negative influence, and family stability.</p>
                    </article>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section>
            <div class="container">
                <div class="section-head">
                    <div>
                        <h2>How the order is fulfilled</h2>
                        <p>The process is intentionally clear so international customers understand that this is a physical product with a personalized recommendation step.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="steps-grid">
                    <article class="step">
                        <div class="step-no">1</div>
                        <h3>Choose focus</h3>
                        <p>Select the life area you want the jewelry to support.</p>
                    </article>
                    <article class="step">
                        <div class="step-no">2</div>
                        <h3>Choose carrier</h3>
                        <p>Pick bracelet or pendant as the physical item.</p>
                    </article>
                    <article class="step">
                        <div class="step-no">3</div>
                        <h3>Submit details</h3>
                        <p>Send your birth date, time, location, and preferences.</p>
                    </article>
                    <article class="step">
                        <div class="step-no">4</div>
                        <h3>Confirm & ship</h3>
                        <p>We confirm the recommended item before shipping it.</p>
                    </article>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section>
            <div class="container">
                <div class="section-head">
                    <div>
                        <h2>Common questions</h2>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="faq-grid">
                    <article class="faq-item">
                        <h3>What if I don't know my birth time?</h3>
                        <p>Leave it blank. We use a day-based reading instead — still accurate enough to recommend the right direction. We'll note the limitation in your recommendation.</p>
                    </article>
                    <article class="faq-item">
                        <h3>How do I know the reading is accurate?</h3>
                        <p>BaZi and Feng Shui have been used for over 1,000 years to map energy patterns. The instant preview shows you your Day Master and elemental balance — you can judge for yourself whether it resonates before ordering the full service.</p>
                    </article>
                    <article class="faq-item">
                        <h3>What does the $99 actually pay for?</h3>
                        <p>The personalized recommendation based on your birth chart. The bracelet or pendant is the physical form the recommendation takes. The material cost of the item is minor — the matching work is what you are paying for.</p>
                    </article>
                    <article class="faq-item">
                        <h3>Can I choose the exact stone or design?</h3>
                        <p>You choose the life focus and whether you want a bracelet or pendant. The material, color, and symbol are recommended after we review your birth chart — and we confirm the final item with you before it ships.</p>
                    </article>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section>
            <div class="container">
                <div class="closing-card">
                    <h2>One life area. One chart-matched piece. $99.</h2>
                    <p>The bracelet or pendant is chosen by your birth chart, confirmed with you before shipping. That's the full service. Try the free preview to see how it works.</p>
                    <div class="hero-actions" style="justify-content:center;">
                        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="instant_reading.html">Try Free Preview</a>
                        <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="checkout.html">Order My Plan — $99</a>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>

    <footer>
        <div class="container footer-card">
            <div>© 2026 Oriental Destiny. Physical Feng Shui jewelry with personalized matching.</div>
            <div>For self-reflection and symbolic lifestyle use. Not medical, legal, or financial advice.</div>
        </div>
    </footer>
</body>
</html>", "exit_code": 0, "error": null}

